    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "The three pipelines to compare",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 13,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**1. Whisper, live only**: where the EU stack started.\n\nWhisper writes the text in 30 second pieces while people talk, and that is the final text. Cheapest, and the least accurate.\n\n**2. Whisper, redone + second listen + clean-up**: the EU stack now.\n\nWhen the conversation ends, the whole recording is written again in one-minute pieces cut at pauses. Stretches where Whisper looks lost (wrong language, speech with few words, silence where someone talked) are listened to a second time, and a text model fixes the spelling of names and terms. Costs about twice the live text, and about the same as Gemini.\n\n**3. Gemini, redone after the conversation**: the GCP stack.\n\nGemini writes the text while people talk and again for the whole recording at the end. A second listen would not help: a second reading barely changes it.\n\nThe chart shows words wrong per 100 against text written by people. Price per audio hour and every other variant are in the table below."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Words wrong per 100 on each test set, the three pipelines",
      "description": "Lower is better. Text checked by people is the reference.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 13,
        "w": 15,
        "x": 9,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "postgres",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "rawSql": "select dataset_label as \"Test set\",\nmax(case when pipeline = 'Whisper, live only' then wer_to_reference * 100 end) as \"Whisper, live only\",\nmax(case when pipeline = 'Whisper, redone + second listen + clean-up' then wer_to_reference * 100 end) as \"Whisper, redone + second listen + clean-up\",\nmax(case when pipeline = 'Gemini, redone after the conversation' then wer_to_reference * 100 end) as \"Gemini, redone after the conversation\"\nfrom obs.transcription_latest where human_text and pipeline is not null group by dataset_label order by 1",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "xField": "Test set",
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "barWidth": 0.8,
        "groupWidth": 0.75,
        "showValue": "auto",
